# ./CITATION.cff
# Citation File Format 1.2.0 — GitHub shows “Cite this repository” from this file.
# Keep version in sync with package.json / src-tauri/tauri.conf.json when tagging.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Genomics Caddy, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Genomics Caddy
version: 0.2.5
date-released: 2026-09-24
abstract: >-
  Local-first desktop DNA explorer for AncestryDNA and 23andMe SNP exports.
  Trait and pharmacogenomics reports, optional Ollama chat, and a stdin/stdout
  MCP server run on the operator’s machine. Research and education only —
  not a diagnostic or treatment product.
authors:
